---
description: AdvisorPPC account changes in Cursor are not all previews
alwaysApply: true
---

AdvisorPPC read tools return data and change nothing.
`advisor_write` returns a preview and applies a change only after the user confirms that preview.
Other change tools do not return a preview. When Cursor runs that call, the change is applied.
Cursor asks before a tool call by default. In Auto-review, an allowlisted tool can run without that ask.
Do not say that every change waits for approval.
